Error [E0138]: `Ms` doesn't support string interpolation
  --> tests/ui/unit_literal_cross_unit_mix.jet:9:13
    |
  9 |     print("{total}")
    |             ^^^^^
 Why: a nominal type only gets the operations its capability bundles grant; `Ms` has only #Numeric, #CodableAsBase
 Fix: add `#Printable` before the declaration, or convert to the base type first
